# The Dragonspiral Tower (the oldest building in Unova, cold stone climbing to where a dragon once slept): a horn in
# C minor over a choir and a low string line, steps up a stair that never ends. It plays the same by day and by night, as the
# original's dungeons do.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
